" data-w=\"14\">with</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"15\">more</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"16\">false</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"17\">alarms)</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"18\">or</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"19\">raise</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"20\">it</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"21\">to</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"22\">be</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"23\">stricter.</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"0\">Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"1\">12</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"2\">shows</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"3\">how</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"4\">to</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"5\">choose</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"6\">with</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"7\">numbers.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-96-more-than-two-classes\"><span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"0\">9.6</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"1\">More</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"2\">than</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"3\">two</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"4\">classes</span></h4>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"0\">Beyond</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"2\">videos.</span></em> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"0\">With</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"1\">more</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"2\">than</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"3\">two</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"4\">classes</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"5\">(the</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"6\">Gmail</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"7\">tabs</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"8\">example)</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"10\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"11\">is</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"12\">replaced</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"13\">by</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"14\">the</span> <strong><span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"15\">softmax</span></strong> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"16\">function.</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"1\">turns</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"2\">one</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"3\">score</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"4\">per</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"5\">class</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"6\">into</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"7\">probabilities</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"8\">that</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"9\">add</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"10\">up</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"11\">to</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"12\">1.</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"1\">will</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"2\">meet</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"3\">it</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"4\">again</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"5\">as</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"7\">last</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"8\">layer</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"9\">of</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"10\">most</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"11\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"12\">networks.</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef sigmoid(z):\n    return 1 / (1 + np.exp(-z))\n\nprint(sigmoid(np.array([-3, -1, 0, 1, 3])).round(3))      # [0.047 0.269 0.5   0.731 0.953]\n\nw, b = np.array([1.0, 1.0]), -3.0\nfor x in ([1, 1], [2, 2], [3, 0]):\n    p = sigmoid(np.dot(w, x) + b)\n    print(x, round(p, 3), \"-&gt;\", int(p &gt;= 0.5))\n# [1, 1] 0.269 -&gt; 0\n# [2, 2] 0.731 -&gt; 1\n# [3, 0] 0.5 -&gt; 1   (exactly on the boundary: the &gt;= rule says 1)\n\np = 0.8\nprint(round(p / (1 - p), 2), round(np.log(p / (1 - p)), 3))   # 4.0 1.386  odds and log-odds\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"0\">Loan</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"1\">example.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"1\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"3\">an</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"4\">offer</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"6\">accepted</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"9\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"10\">of</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"11\">w1</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"12\">x</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"13\">amount</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"14\">+</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"15\">w2</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"16\">x</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"17\">terms</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"18\">+</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"19\">w3</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"20\">x</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"21\">credit</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"22\">score</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"23\">+</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"24\">b.</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"25\">A</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"26\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"27\">of</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"28\">0.83</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"29\">means</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"30\">\"about</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"31\">83</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"32\">of</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"33\">100</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"34\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"35\">like</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"36\">this</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"37\">are</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"38\">accepted\".</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"0\">You</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"1\">can</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"2\">rank</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"3\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"4\">by</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"5\">it,</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"6\">or</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"7\">turn</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"8\">it</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"9\">into</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"11\">decision</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"12\">with</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"13\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"14\">threshold,</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"15\">and</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"17\">customer-facing</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"18\">explanation</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"19\">can</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"20\">use</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"21\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"22\">weights:</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"23\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"24\">larger</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"25\">amount</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"26\">lowers</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"27\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"28\">odds</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"29\">of</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"30\">acceptance</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"31\">by</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"32\">a</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"33\">certain</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"34\">factor.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"0\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"1\">mistakes</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"0\">Using</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"1\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"2\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"3\">on</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"5\">0</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"6\">or</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"7\">1</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"8\">target.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"0\">Thinking</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"2\">model</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"3\">output</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"6\">certainty.</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"3\">probability,</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"5\">only</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"6\">as</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"7\">good</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"8\">as</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"9\">its</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"10\">calibration</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"11\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"12\">12).</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"0\">Treating</span> <span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"1\">0.5</span> <span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"2\">as</span> <span data-s=\"62\" data-w=\"3\">sacred.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"0\">Forgetting</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"1\">to</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"2\">scale</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"4\">features</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"5\">before</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"6\">training</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"7\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"63\" data-w=\"8\">8).</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Check yourself</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compute sigmoid(0) and say what it means.</li>\n<li>For w = [2, -1], b = 1 and x = [1, 3], what is z, and what does the model predict?</li>\n<li>Why can a straight line not be the model for yes or no data?</li>\n<li>A probability is 0.2. What are the odds?</li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"answers\"><summary>Show answers</summary><p> (1) 0.5: the model is undecided, and the input is on the decision boundary. (2) z = 2 x 1 - 1 x 3 + 1 = 0, so the probability is 0.5, exactly on the boundary. (3) It gives values outside 0 and 1, and a single outlier can move its threshold. (4) 0.2 / 0.8 = 0.25, which is 1 to 4.</p></details>\n<p><strong>Go deeper:</strong> Ng, course 1, videos 31 to 33 · StatQuest, <a class=\"vlink\" href=\"#/watch/yIYKR4sgzI8\">Logistic Regression</a> (9 minutes) and, for log-odds, <a class=\"vlink\" href=\"#/watch/ARfXDSkQf1Y\">Odds and Log(Odds), Clearly Explained</a> · the scikit-learn <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html#logistic-regression\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">logistic regression section</a>.</p>\n"}